WEBVTT

1
00:00:03,340 --> 00:00:04,380
Follow me back to base

2
00:00:04,740 --> 00:00:06,060
People there will cure you

3
00:00:06,580 --> 00:00:11,490
It was he who dug me out of the grave

4
00:00:11,490 --> 00:00:12,730
It's the people here who take care of me

5
00:00:13,620 --> 00:00:14,900
I chose this myself

6
00:00:17,100 --> 00:00:19,140
Du Ling never attacked me or helped me.

7
00:00:19,500 --> 00:00:21,220
Can you two go to Yanguang?

8
00:00:21,220 --> 00:00:22,300
He broke down my door

9
00:00:22,300 --> 00:00:23,700
Xiaomei was also the first to get hurt.

10
00:00:24,100 --> 00:00:25,100
He wants to stay and pay off the debt

11
00:00:33,570 --> 00:00:35,870
You can't remember better from today

12
00:00:36,430 --> 00:00:38,150
I'm here to pay off my debt for what you've done.
